WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,050
Senior Sister, where does Master go every day? I haven’t seen him much these days.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:08,550
We, Wei Yufeng, also have a sixth-level elixir garden, where the master takes care of the spiritual plants on weekdays.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:11,050
I didn’t expect that there is a sixth-level elixir garden. Can I go and have a look?

4
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,550
Of course you can. You are the master's apprentice.

5
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:16,050
When your injury heals, I will naturally go to help you.

6
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,550
When the time comes, you won’t be able to steal even if you want to be lazy.

7
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:21,550
It is said that the spiritual plants of high-grade spiritual plants are almost the same as spiritual beasts.

8
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:25,050
The fifth-level dragon weapon algae I encountered last time did not show any signs of spiritual growth.

9
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:28,550
I don’t know if the sixth level spiritual plant cultivated by the master has opened the spiritual plant.

10
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,910
The spiritual cultivation method has been cultivated to the third level of perfection.

11
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,910
How can we go further?
